:"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-05T18:06:16-07:00","id":1513981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xela_nut</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1513657-cofd-fan-gameline-where-you-play-as-a-final-boss?p=1513969#post1513969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are definitely a lot of good ideas here and given by other people. You raise the point that they should be able to take on mages, and that is a good point. And they should be able to have at least a chance of beating a pack of werewolves, otherwise they couldn't serve as a final boss for them. One of the biggest things that worried me about it was that the Dark Masters weren't powerful enough or maybe too powerful. One thing that is definitely becoming clear to me is that I can't do this on me own or with bits of advice like this. I need something far more focused, methodical, and bit by bit than we can reasonably accomplish in these forums.<br /> <br /> So, I might go with my idea of making a Discord server. Then, I could turn the splat and/or sub-template into a full group project. I also might make the Dark Masters into two separate things, both splats and sub-templates, so I can have the best of both worlds.<br /> <br /> If I decide to make a Discord server and turn this into a large group project, would anyone here be interested in being involved in it? There are so many different ideas that were given here, and I'm not even fully sure what to do at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd definitely be interested, though like I said before I may be a bit slow at times (honestly it's mostly a personality thing there, sometimes I get into moods where I don't feel like doing much other than watching stuff), but I can do my best.<br /> <br /> I definitely think making a full template and a sub-template would be best, and I would recommend making Dark Masters less common (specifically in regards to them making full Dark Masters by reproducing, I definitely like the idea but it should probably be rare for much the same reason that Leviathans are rare; the more powerful the splat, the less common they can be without it not making sense as to how they haven't already taken over everything).<br /> <br /> I also have quite a few ideas in regards to making them more powerful, as high powered games are ones that I enjoy, and while I haven't released much of anything I have been working on some stuff personally for a while now. Not sure if it will actually work in practice, but that's what play testing and feedback are for.<br /> <br /> Send me a link to the Discord whenever you get it up, I'm definitely interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12947-enderdragon1201","name":"Enderdragon1201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12947_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T07:36:14-07:00","id":1514011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enderdragon1201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1513657-cofd-fan-gameline